                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='31391' id='261' type-v2='text' w='75392' x='422' y='35199'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='18'>INFO:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Channel grouping is done on the following basis</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>      1. PM Channels consist of: APP_REACH, APP_RMA, DISPLAY_REACH, DISPLAY_RMA, PAIDSOCIAL_REACH, PAIDSOCIAL_RMA, SEM_CATEGORY, SEM_COMPETITOR, SEM_GENERIC, SEM_SHOPPING, SEM_VENDOR and SEO_NONBRAND</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>       2. SEM Brand channel consists of: BRAND_SEM and BRAND_SEO.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>       3. All the Other remaining channels are considered as Other Channels</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Brand Level and Segment Level Summary KPI consist of data for the past 2 completed months. The KPI&apos;s are for the last completed month(M-1) and comparision to the (M-2)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>- Marketing Mix and Topline overview views is presented for the last 12 months on the running basis.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='243' h='31391' id='262' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/st15_case_deliveryhero_01_0.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='23764' x='75814' y='35199'>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8279' id='267' type-v2='text' w='99156' x='422' y='66590'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>For any comments or feedback related to data and the report.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>Please reach out to our slack channel</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>#mkt_report_alerts</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
